## "Near Me" Means We Come to Your Venue

We have been active in the audio visual industry in Malaga since 1996. Today we operate a delivery only model, with no physical storefront to visit. Instead, our crew brings the sound systems, lighting rigs and cabling directly to your villa, finca or hotel, wherever your wedding is happening across Malaga and the Costa del Sol.

That matters for how you should read a "near me" search. A wedding venue or a furniture rental company might genuinely want you to visit a showroom before you book. We do not, because there is nothing here for you to see in person. The Wedding Pack exists at your venue on the day, not on a shelf. If proximity is what you are searching for, the honest answer is that we travel to you, not the other way around.

