## What the Wedding Pack Delivers to Your Venue

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) is the one thing we bring to a wedding near you, and it covers a specific, bounded slice of a wedding's needs:

-   A high end active PA sound system for up to 80 guests.
-   Fairy lights and warm LED strings for ambient lighting.
-   Professional wireless microphones for speeches and announcements.
-   Transport to your venue in Malaga and surrounding areas.
-   Professional setup and cabling.
-   A live technician on site throughout the event.
-   Post event teardown and pickup.

That is sound, lighting, microphones and a technician, for 650 euros ex VAT. It does not include chairs, tables, linens, catering or decor. For how that slice fits into everything else a wedding actually needs, see our [essential items for wedding rentals](/blog/essential-items-for-wedding-rentals/) guide, and for how our delivery only setup covers what we actually bring, see [protecting your wedding rental items](/blog/protecting-your-wedding-rental-items/).

## How Far "Near Me" Actually Reaches

Our service area is centered on Malaga and the Costa del Sol. We also extend to Granada, though rentals there need to exceed 400 euros to cover the added travel for a single day trip out of the province. We do not have named district or neighborhood level coverage to list beyond that. If your venue is in Malaga or within the wider Costa del Sol, you are inside our normal delivery area. If it is in Granada, check that your rental clears the 400 euro threshold before you book.

