## FAQs

### What does "near me" mean if Malaga Event Gear has no showroom?

It means proximity of delivery, not a location to visit. We operate delivery only, with no storefront, and bring the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) directly to your venue for setup, live technical support and teardown.

### What is included in the Wedding Pack?

PA sound for up to 80 guests, fairy light and warm LED ambient lighting, wireless microphones, transport, professional setup and a live technician on site, for 650 euros ex VAT. See the full breakdown on our [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) page.

### Do you serve areas outside Malaga city?

Yes. Our service area covers Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol, and extends to Granada for rentals over 400 euros to cover the added travel distance.

### How far in advance do I need to book?

All bookings need at least 24 hours' notice. For a wedding date, contact us as soon as your venue is confirmed so we can hold the crew and equipment for your day.
